<title>DENMARK: TENNIS-JOHANSSON BEATS DAMM IN COPENHAGEN OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-JOHANSSON BEATS DAMM IN COPENHAGEN OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the $203,000 Copenhagen Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat 2-Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 6-4 3-6 6-2</p>
</text>
